1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,718
The ice cream is in your mouth.

2
00:00:01,718 --> 00:00:03,286
So why does your forehead hurt?

3
00:00:03,786 --> 00:00:05,202
Your brain is not freezing.

4
00:00:05,202 --> 00:00:06,828
Look at the roof of your mouth.

5
00:00:07,328 --> 00:00:11,165
The cold makes its blood vessels clamp shut, then flood wide open.

6
00:00:11,665 --> 00:00:16,642
The nerve that reports it also covers your forehead, so your brain blames the wrong spot.

7
00:00:17,142 --> 00:00:20,800
In one trial, gulping it more than doubled the chance of getting one.

8
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:25,473
Doctors suggest pressing your tongue to the roof of your mouth, to warm it back up.

9
00:00:25,973 --> 00:00:27,206
Fast eater or slow?
